# "Version 2" pages now self-protect with in-page noindex + canonical
# (or, for whopcheckout2.php, an inline <meta name="robots"> noindex
# tag). They MUST remain crawlable so Google can see those signals
# and properly deindex -- URLs blocked by robots.txt stay in the
# index indefinitely as "Indexed, though blocked by robots.txt"
# zombies because the crawler never sees the deindex directive.
#
# Re-evaluate adding these Disallow lines back in ~3-6 months once
# GSC confirms the URLs have fully deindexed.
#
# RelieversRender2.php is intentionally kept blocked: it's a
# server-side include used by Game-Relievers2.php, not a
# directly-indexable page.
Disallow: /RelieversRender2.php

